          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "13",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Avalaamu ookĩlya metho, oona, na, sisya, ĩtina wake ndũũme ĩkwetwe mbya syayo nĩ kĩkuthu: na Avalaamu aenda na oosa ndũũme, na amĩthemba nthembo ya kũvĩvw’a vandũ va mwana wake. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.13",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.13"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "14",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:14"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "14",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na Avalaamu eeta vandũ vau syĩtwa yavo Yeova‐yile: o tondũ kwaaw’a kũvika mũnthĩ ũũ, Kĩĩmanĩ kya Yeova kĩkooneka. ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.14",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.14"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "15",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:15"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "15",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "Na mũlaĩka wa Yeova amwĩta Avalaamu ya kelĩ e ĩtunĩ, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.15",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.15"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
          "name": "verse",
          "type": "tag",
          "attrs": {
            "number": "16",
            "style": "v",
            "sid": "GEN 22:16"
          },
          "items": [
            {
              "text": "16",
              "type": "text"
            }
          ]
        },
        {
          "text": "na amwĩa, Nyie mwene nĩneevĩta, Yeova easya ũu, nũndũ nĩweeka ũndũ ũũ, na ndũnambata mwana waku, mwana waku e ũmwe, ",
          "type": "text",
          "attrs": {
            "verseId": "GEN.22.16",
            "verseOrgIds": [
              "GEN.22.16"
            ]
          }
        },
        {
